      "lineType": "narration",
      "sequence": 1,
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "text": "社区修理铺门口贴出了停业通知，屋里的旧钟仍在走动。"
    },
    {
      "emotion": "calm",
      "episodeNumber": 1,
      "lineId": "E01-L002",
      "lineType": "dialogue",
      "sequence": 2,
      "speakerId": "protagonist",
      "text": "钟表匠林夏决定整理每件旧物背后的维修记录。"
    },
    {
      "emotion": "calm",
      "episodeNumber": 2,
      "lineId": "E02-L001",
      "lineType": "narration",
      "sequence": 1,
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "text": "邻居们带着故事回来，也找到了被遗漏的公共服务协议。"
    },
    {
      "emotion": "hopeful",
      "episodeNumber": 2,
      "lineId": "E02-L002",
      "lineType": "dialogue",
      "sequence": 2,
      "speakerId": "protagonist",
      "text": "协议通过核验，修理铺改为社区共管，并重新亮起灯牌。"
    }
  ]
}
